<Item XName="Equations" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% Setup of SamplingRates&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingTable  = [ 1.92 3.84 7.68 15.36 23.04 30.72 ];&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingFreq   = 1e6 * SamplingTable(Bandwidth + 1);&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingRate   = SamplingFreq * (2^OversamplingOption);&#x000D;&#x000A;SampsPerSF     = 0.001 * SamplingRate;&#x000D;&#x000A;SampsPerFrame  = 10 * SampsPerSF;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;NomGain        = tune(-10);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%cosim block size --- samples per subframe must be divisible by CosimBlockSize&#x000D;&#x000A;CosimBlockSize = SampsPerSF/600;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
<UnitUse><T>Int</T><D>2</D></UnitUse>
