<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>The new RFAMP model in SystemVue contains &#x000D;&#x000A;parameters for both AM-to-AM and AM-to-PM. &#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&quot;AMtoPM&quot; is in deg/dB and can be either positive &#x000D;&#x000A;or negative, so you can have either type of slope &#x000D;&#x000A;for the phase characteristic.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&quot;PwrAMtoPM&quot; sets the output power level at &#x000D;&#x000A;which the slope is specified.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
